     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "Stakeholder management works best when we define who are our stakeholders and how their contributions affect our business. The best method to manage our communication with stakeholders is as follows: make a plan, define who your stakeholders are, tailor your communication and message, be inclusive to all stakeholders, communicate clearly and listen, follow up, be flexible and ready to adapt, encourage participation, track your interactions, define what success looks like, and provide reports and updates to all involved."
    }
